{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OUDSButton","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Layouts","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/Actions"],"kind":"mentions"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Appearances","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Appearances"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Five appearances are proposed for all layouts:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"default (by default)","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Default buttons are used for actions which are not mandatory or essential for the user."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"strong"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Should be singular and prominent, limited to one per view."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It should be reserved for the most critical action, such as “Next,” “Save,” “Submit,” etc. It is a “call for action”."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"brand"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": A brand primary color alternative to the "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"strong","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" button."},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"To be used sparingly for high-value specific actions or to visually anchor a brand moment. Do not use it as the default primary button in your interfaces."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A button with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSButton.Appearance.Brand"},{"type":"text","text":" appearance is not allowed as a direct or indirect child of an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSColoredSurface"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"minimal"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Minimal buttons are commonly used for actions that are considered less crucial. They can be used independently or together with a strong button."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"negative"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Negative buttons should be used sparingly to warn of a destructive action,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for example, delete or remove, typically resulting in the opening of a confirmation dialog."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"A button with ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSButton.Appearance.Negative"},{"type":"text","text":" appearance is not allowed as a direct or indirect child of an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSColoredSurface"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}]},{"level":2,"anchor":"Code-samples","text":"Code samples","type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ Icon only with default appearance","    OUDSButton(image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(\"ic_heart\")), accessibilityLabel: \"Like\", appearance: .default) { \/* the action to process *\/ }","    \/\/ Or simpler","    OUDSButton(image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(\"ic_heart\")), accessibilityLabel: \"Like\") { \/* the action to process *\/ }","    \/\/ With an image to keep raw without tint","    OUDSButton(image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(\"il_someImage\")), accessibilityLabel: \"Like\", renderingMode: .original) { \/* the action to process *\/ }","","    \/\/ Text only with negative appearance","    OUDSButton(text: \"Delete\", appearance: .negative,  style: .default) { \/* the action to process *\/ }","    \/\/ Or simpler","    OUDSButton(text: \"Delete\", appearance: .negative) { \/* the action to process *\/ }","","    \/\/ A small loading button with indeterminate progress","    OUDSButton(text: \"Delete\", style: .loading(), size: .small) { \/* the action to process *\/ }","","    \/\/ A small loading button with a progress (i.e. percent of progress)","    OUDSButton(text: \"Delete\", style: .loading(progress: 0.75), size: .small) { \/* the action to process *\/ }","","    \/\/ Text and icon with strong appearance","    OUDSButton(text: \"Validate\", image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(\"ic_heart\")), appearance: .strong) { \/* the action to process *\/ }","","    \/\/ Text and icon with strong appearance and button taking full width","    OUDSButton(text: \"Validate\", image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(\"ic_heart\")), appearance: .strong, isFullWidth: true) { \/* the action to process *\/ }","","    \/\/ Localizable from bundle can also be used","    OUDSButton(LocalizedStringKey(\"validate_button\"), bundle: Bundle.module, appearance: .strong) { }"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If you need to flip your icon depending to the layout direction or not (e.g. if RTL mode lose semantics  \/ meanings):","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["    @Environment(\\.layoutDirection) var layoutDirection","","    OUDSButton(text: \"Button\",","               image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"figure.handball\"), flipped: layoutDirection == .rightToLeft))"]},{"text":"Sizes","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Sizes"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Two sizes of button are proposed for all layouts:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Default","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": This is the default size of the component. This size is used for the vast majority of applications.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"small","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": This size can be particularly useful in an information-dense interface or in the construction of","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a template or component requiring the use of small elements (in an “List item” component, for example).","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Styles","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Styles"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Two style are available:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"default (by default)"}]},{"type":"text","text":": used in the normal usage of button. The aspect of the button changes for  states "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"disabled"}]},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"pressed","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"hovered"}]},{"text":" or normal (i.e. ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"enabled"}]},{"text":")","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"loading"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": used after button was clicked (and probably data are requested before navigate to a next screen or get updated data, etc.).","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Rounded-layout","type":"heading","text":"Rounded layout"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Buttons can have rounded layouts to be favored in more emotional, immersive contexts or those tied to specific visual identities."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For standard or business-oriented journeys, keep the default corners."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This evolution addresses the need for flexibility in adapting the design to some brand contexts."}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To activate the rounded button behavior, set to true the ","type":"text"},{"code":"hasRoundedButtons","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" values of the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Tuning"},{"type":"text","text":" object"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in your theme configuration (if the theme exposes this property at init)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Some themes do not have this flexibility like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SoshTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"WireframeTheme"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Colored-surface","text":"Colored surface","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If button is placed on colored surface using ","type":"text"},{"code":"OUDSColoredSurface","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", the default colors (content, background and border) are automatically adjusted to switch to monochrome mode.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Remark: Today it is not allowed to place a Negative nor a Brand button on a colored surface."}]}]},{"text":"Specific behavior","level":2,"anchor":"Specific-behavior","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For accessibility reasons, if the system settings for reducing motion is enabled, the loading indicator does not move.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"For ecodesign reasons, if the device is in low power mode, the loading indicator does not move.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Design documentation","level":2,"anchor":"Design-documentation","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"https:\/\/r.orange.fr\/r\/S-ouds-doc-button","type":"reference","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Themes rendering","level":2,"anchor":"Themes-rendering","type":"heading"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Orange","text":"Orange","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_button_Orange","type":"image"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Orange-Compact","text":"Orange Compact","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_button_OrangeCompact","type":"image"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Sosh","text":"Sosh","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_button_Sosh"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Wireframe","text":"Wireframe","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_button_Wireframe"}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Version","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"3.4.0 (Figma component design version)"}]}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Since","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"0.10.0"}]}]}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton"},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton\/init(_:tableName:bundle:appearance:style:size:isFullWidth:action:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton\/init(_:tableName:bundle:image:appearance:style:size:isFullWidth:action:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton\/init(image:appearance:style:size:isFullWidth:action:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton\/init(text:appearance:style:size:isFullWidth:action:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton\/init(text:image:appearance:style:size:isFullWidth:action:)"],"anchor":"Initializers"},{"generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSButton\/body"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"generated":true,"title":"Enumerations","identifiers":["